  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Escape to Willow & Waves in Inlet Beach! This spacious 4-bed, 2.5-bath home sleeps 7, perfect for families. Enjoy a 6-seater golf cart, community pool right across the street, 4 bikes, and a private backyard with a fire pit. Just a 2-minute ride to the beach and moments from Rosemary Beach & 30A, this retreat offers the ultimate coastal getaway with modern comforts and easy access to world-class dining and shops. <br>Guests will have full and private access to the entire 4-bedroom house. Your access also includes all provided amenities:<br> Entire private home<br> Community pool located across the street<br> 6-seater golf cart (waiver required)<br> 4 adult bikes<br><br>Check-in is virtual for your convenience. <br> Check-in: 4:00 PM<br> Check-out: 10:00 AM<br><br>We prioritize your privacy and comfort. Our team offers a seamless virtual check-in process and will not be on-site during your stay. However, we are always available to assist you through our Guest Portal or by phone should you need anything to make your vacation perfect.<br><br>Guest Confirmation: After booking, you will receive a link to our Guest Portal to confirm your reservation, provide contact information, and upload a photo of you holding your ID. This must be completed within 72 hours to avoid cancellation.<br> Golf Cart: The golf cart is included with your reservation but provided through a 3rd-party vendor. The primary guest will be required to sign a Golf Cart Waiver and pay a $30+ tax service fee directly to the vendor.<br> Starter Supplies: We provide a starter kit of supplies, including 1 roll of paper towels, 1 dish soap, 3 dish pods, 1 sponge, 3 laundry pods, 2 rolls of toilet paper per bathroom, and 1 bar of hand soap per sink. Guests are responsible for any additional items needed.<br> Linens: All bed linens, bath linens, and beach towels are provided for your stay.<br> Area Construction: Please be aware that construction is ongoing throughout Panama City Beach and 30A. We cannot be held responsible for construction-related noise or disruptions.<br> Payment & Cancellation: We accept Visa, MasterCard, Discover, and AMEX only; we do not accept wire transfers or checks. The cancellation policy will be strictly enforced, and no additional refunds will be issued outside of it.<br><br>House Rules<br>No Smoking inside the condo or on the balconies<br>No Pets<br>No parties or events without prior approval<br>Check-in time: 4:00 PM | Check-out time: 10:00 AM<br>Age Requirement: The booking guest must be 25 or older<br>Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 7:00 AM <br>Treat this home with care & enjoy your time in paradise!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Spacious Inlet Home with Golf Cart & Bikes"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
