            "response": "Wow—thank you for such a thoughtful and detailed review! We’re thrilled you enjoyed the comfort, updates, and amenities of the home, and that the beach chairs, towels, and golf cart made your stay even more convenient. It’s great to hear you found the location perfect for both relaxing and exploring nearby spots like Ghost Crab Pizza and the Donut Hole. We truly appreciate your kind words about our service—it’s always a pleasure to help guests make the most of their vacation. We’d be honored to host you again for another wonderful beach getaway! 🌴☀️",
